# Migrations

Alembic migrations for traia. The database URL is loaded from `.env` via
`app.core.config.settings` — not from `alembic.ini`.

## Commands

Create:   alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"
Apply:    alembic upgrade head
Rollback: alembic downgrade -1
History:  alembic history
Current:  alembic current
Heads:    alembic heads

## Requirements

- `.env` must define `POSTGRES_*` variables.
- Every ORM model must be imported in `app/models/__init__.py` so autogenerate
  sees all tables on `Base.metadata`.
- New revision files are auto-formatted by ruff (see `alembic.ini` post_write_hooks).
